# Hero-camera demo clips (ingest/local_clips/*.mp4) are deliberately
# COMMITTED, not ignored -- 3 Sept: so anyone on the team can clone and
# run the hero-camera demo immediately without needing the sandbox
# credential or re-recording against a flaky live RTSP source. See
# ingest/local_clips/README.md for the exact files and sizes.
#
# Offline-verification extracts (regenerable: scan_hero_candidate.py
# re-extracts from the clip in ~1 min) and pixel-crop evidence dirs
ingest/local_clips/scan_*/
# Transient live-stack pid/log files
*_pid.txt
ingest/ingest_live*.log
ml/ml_live*.log

# 4 Sept: runtime upload-storage dir created by api/app/routers/
# camera_onboarding.py (pre-recorded video onboarding) -- real user
# uploads at runtime, not source/fixture content.
api/app/uploads/

# deploy/ (cloud GPU bring-up): the real per-team credential and runtime
# pid/log files -- never commit these. The scripts themselves are fine.
deploy/stack.env
deploy/logs/

